{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The SQLite billing migration in `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/migration.sql` is unsafe and incomplete.\n\nRead `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/migration_policy.md`, then repair the migration package.\n\nYour job:\n- Edit `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/migration.sql`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/preflight_report.md`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/rollback.sql`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/postcheck.sql`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/090-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-041716-e2d6ff57/workspace/in/billingdb/migration_report.md`.\n\nRequired behavior:\n- Preserve all invoices and payments from `schema.sql`.\n- Add non-null `status` to invoices with default `open`.\n- Preserve historical invoice `created_at`.\n- Preserve orphan payments by moving them to `payment_orphans` before enforcing referential safety.\n- Enforce future `payments.invoice_id` references to valid invoices.\n- The migration must run inside an explicit transaction.\n- The migration must be idempotent: running it a second time must not duplicate or corrupt data.\n- Rollback must execute after the migration and restore the old table shape: `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify `schema.sql` or `migration_policy.md`.\n- Do not delete orphan payment `p4`; preserve it in `payment_orphans`.\n- Do not disable foreign keys without restoring them.\n- Do not hard-code a solution that only works by deleting existing rows.\n- Do not use external services or non-SQLite features.\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1788164237377}}
