{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PglMLj0i4vvW1sM7tBRgfVo0|fc_0b934691588eb3e1016a9538edade487d28077cf67a8df15fd","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Create preflight report","path":"/workspace/in/billingdb/preflight_report.md","content":"# Billing migration preflight\n\n## Scope\n\nThe migration rebuilds `invoices` with a non-null `status` column and rebuilds\n`payments` with a foreign key to `invoices(id)`. SQLite foreign-key enforcement\nis disabled only during the table swaps and is explicitly enabled again after\nthe transaction. Existing invalid payment references are copied first to\n`payment_orphans`; they are never deleted.\n\n## Seed inventory\n\n| Check | Expected |\n|---|---:|\n| invoices before migration | 3 |\n| payments before migration | 4 |\n| payments referencing a missing invoice | 1 |\n| orphan identifier | `p4` |\n| orphan invoice reference | `missing-invoice` |\n\nThe orphan row is `p4`, amount `700`, created at\n`2024-01-07T10:00:00Z`. It must remain in `payment_orphans`.\n\n## Run before migration\n\n```sql\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS invoice_count FROM invoices;\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS payment_count FROM payments;\nSELECT p.id, p.invoice_id, p.amount_cents, p.created_at\nFROM payments AS p\nLEFT JOIN invoices AS i ON i.id = p.invoice_id\nWHERE i.id IS NULL;\n```\n\nThe migration is safe to proceed when the orphan list is reviewed and the\ncounts match the inventory above (or are otherwise explicitly approved).\n`postcheck.sql` contains the after-migration assertions.\n"},"intent":"Create preflight report"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1043,"output":353,"cacheRead":21248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22644,"cost":{"input":0.00020860000000000003,"output":0.0004236,"cacheRead":0.00042496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0010571600000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788164332240,"responseId":"resp_0b934691588eb3e1016a9538ec9ea087d28743caca83a69c08","duration":7665.019591999997,"ttft":1492.675589999999},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PglMLj0i4vvW1sM7tBRgfVo0|fc_0b934691588eb3e1016a9538edade487d28077cf67a8df15fd","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/billingdb/preflight_report.md#9FAA]\nSuccessfully wrote 1230 bytes to in/billingdb/preflight_report.md"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/in/billingdb/preflight_report.md"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788164339914}]}
