orts\n  Verify:\n    - [X] Run SQLite migration and rollback scenarios\n    - [X] Review generated artifacts and constraints"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Inspect","tasks":[{"content":"Read migration policy and schema","status":"completed"},{"content":"Inspect existing migration package","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Implement","tasks":[{"content":"Repair migration SQL transaction and idempotence","status":"completed"},{"content":"Create preflight rollback and postcheck SQL","status":"completed"},{"content":"Create migration and preflight reports","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verify","tasks":[{"content":"Run SQLite migration and rollback scenarios","status":"completed"},{"content":"Review generated artifacts and constraints","status":"completed"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Verify","content":"Review generated artifacts and constraints"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788164407473},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Repaired `/workspace/in/billingdb`:\n\n- `migration.sql`\n  - Explicit `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transaction.\n  - Preserves invoice fields and historical `created_at`.\n  - Adds `status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'open'`.\n  - Archives orphan `p4` in `payment_orphans`.\n  - Rebuilds `payments` with a foreign key to `invoices(id)`.\n  - Restores `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON`.\n  - Safe to run repeatedly without duplicating rows.\n\n- Created `rollback.sql`\n  - Restores legacy invoice and payment table shapes.\n  - Restores archived orphan payments, including `p4`.\n  - Preserves `payment_orphans` as an audit archive.\n  - Transactional and repeatable.\n\n- Created `postcheck.sql`\n  - Validates counts, orphan preservation, status defaults, invalid references, and foreign-key integrity.\n\n- Created `preflight_report.md`\n  - Documents expected seed counts and orphan `p4`.\n\n- Created `migration_report.md`\n  - Documents migration behavior, idempotence, rollback, and expected verification results.\n\nVerification performed against the supplied schema:\n\n- Migration succeeded.\n- Second migration run retained counts: 3 invoices, 3 payments, 1 orphan.\n- `p4` preserved with original values.\n- Invoice timestamps preserved.\n- Invalid future payment reference rejected with `IntegrityError`.\n- Rollback restored all 4 payments, including `p4`.\n- Rollback restored legacy table definitions.\n- Foreign-key checks returned no violations and enforcement was enabled.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b934691588eb3e1016a9539381ad087d29929db8a38a5b48a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1168,"output":323,"cacheRead":27392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28883,"cost":{"input":0.0002336,"output":0.0003876,"cacheRead":0.00054784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00116904}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788164407504,"responseId":"resp_0b934691588eb3e1016a953937c7ac87d296048582c36d8979","duration":6540.925445000001,"ttft":651.4905030000082}],"isTerminal":true}
